WEBVTT

00:00:11.687 --> 00:00:15.774
The descendants of Doronjo,
Boyacky, and Tonzra…

00:00:15.774 --> 00:00:18.735
I see… You resemble your
ancestors quite a bit…

00:00:18.735 --> 00:00:21.822
though it could just be my imagination.

00:00:21.822 --> 00:00:26.535
Oh, my dear descendant of Doronjo…
descendants of Doronbow…

00:00:26.535 --> 00:00:29.830
Welcome!

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:51.960
Absent-minded, I only prayed to the stars

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:57.760
Losing sight of all that was precious

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.600
Absent-minded, I kept my eyes fixed on the same spot

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:08.310
And came to a standstill myself

00:01:10.230 --> 00:01:13.480
We don't need no reasons

00:01:15.610 --> 00:01:18.570
To change for the better

00:01:18.910 --> 00:01:25.870
Now, let's dream to the extreme

00:01:25.870 --> 00:01:27.960
You're a shooting star

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:31.250
Kick open the doors that stand in your way

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:36.470
And leap beyond the infinite horizon

00:01:36.470 --> 00:01:38.550
Light on the shooting star

00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:44.560
Don't look back; what you seek is in front of you

00:01:44.560 --> 00:01:47.680
Let's go in search of it

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:52.440
Fly away

00:02:03.799 --> 00:02:06.302
Hm? What’s the matter?

00:02:06.302 --> 00:02:08.596
Y-You’re Great Dokurobey, right?

00:02:08.596 --> 00:02:09.722
That’s right.

00:02:09.722 --> 00:02:10.890
Why?

00:02:10.890 --> 00:02:12.850
What do you mean "why"?

00:02:12.850 --> 00:02:14.894
We thought it was Yatterman…

00:02:14.894 --> 00:02:16.562
Ah, Yatterman, huh?

00:02:16.562 --> 00:02:18.648
…who we were going to meet.

00:02:18.648 --> 00:02:20.233
They’re not here.

00:02:20.233 --> 00:02:21.525
They’re not here?

00:02:21.525 --> 00:02:22.902
Yatterman, right?

00:02:22.902 --> 00:02:24.487
Where did they go, oink?

00:02:24.487 --> 00:02:25.780
Bathroom?

00:02:25.780 --> 00:02:27.740
I defeated them.

00:02:27.740 --> 00:02:29.075
You defeated them?!

00:02:29.075 --> 00:02:30.076
That’s right.

00:02:30.076 --> 00:02:32.119
H-Hold on a sec!

00:02:32.119 --> 00:02:34.163
Whispering… Whispering…

00:02:34.163 --> 00:02:36.082
Wh-What’s going on?

00:02:36.082 --> 00:02:39.543
Maybe the man over there is a
descendant of Great Dokurobey,

00:02:39.543 --> 00:02:42.505
just like we’re the descendants of Doronbow?

00:02:42.505 --> 00:02:43.631
I see.

00:02:43.631 --> 00:02:46.133
He said he defeated Yatterman.

00:02:46.133 --> 00:02:49.095
He probably did it before we came.

00:02:49.095 --> 00:02:50.096
That must be it!

00:02:50.096 --> 00:02:51.555
It’s a happy ending.

00:02:51.555 --> 00:02:52.807
I'm not so sure…

00:02:52.807 --> 00:02:54.058
Gatchan?

00:02:54.058 --> 00:02:55.518
Think about it.

00:02:56.477 --> 00:02:57.895
It’s strange, isn’t it?

00:02:57.895 --> 00:03:00.398
Why are the Yatter soldiers
not saying anything?

00:03:00.398 --> 00:03:01.774
True!

00:03:01.774 --> 00:03:04.652
And, we’re still prisoners.

00:03:04.652 --> 00:03:05.653
Ahhh!

00:03:05.653 --> 00:03:07.697
This is so confusing!

00:03:07.697 --> 00:03:12.076
Er, are you done yet? I'm busy, you know.

00:03:12.076 --> 00:03:14.453
U-Uhm, Great Dokurobey…

00:03:14.453 --> 00:03:15.538
What is it?

00:03:15.538 --> 00:03:18.624
Well, we don’t really
understand the situation.

00:03:18.624 --> 00:03:22.003
Could you explain what’s going on?

00:03:22.003 --> 00:03:25.881
Geez, they sure were high-maintenance,

00:03:25.881 --> 00:03:29.176
but so are their descendants.

00:03:38.561 --> 00:03:40.229
Here you go, sir.

00:03:40.229 --> 00:03:41.647
Tada!

00:03:41.647 --> 00:03:44.900
Listen up and listen good!

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:48.321
This is my, Great Dokurobey’s, glorious history!

00:03:48.321 --> 00:03:51.282
And, <i>click!</i>

00:03:59.248 --> 00:04:02.918
Find the cute high school girls
around the country!

00:04:02.918 --> 00:04:04.670
What? High-school-girls?

00:04:04.670 --> 00:04:08.132
Hey, you, high school girls!
May I interview you?

00:04:08.132 --> 00:04:11.635
Well, we all, like,
go to karaoke after school.

00:04:11.635 --> 00:04:15.139
I wanna work part time
after school, but daddy says no.

00:04:15.139 --> 00:04:17.475
Gyary Bamyo Bamyo’s super cute!

00:04:17.475 --> 00:04:19.602
Hey, this isn’t the right videotape!

00:04:19.602 --> 00:04:23.022
Oh, no! I'm sorry, sir! I played
my own videotape by mistake!

00:04:23.022 --> 00:04:26.192
You idiot! I’ll punish you later!

00:04:26.192 --> 00:04:28.110
I’ll be glad to receive it, sir!

00:04:28.110 --> 00:04:30.112
So those are "high-school-girls"…

00:04:30.112 --> 00:04:33.199
Boyayan, I'm happy for you.
The mystery is solved!

00:04:33.199 --> 00:04:37.328
I wanna be friends with high-school-girls
from around the country!

00:04:37.328 --> 00:04:40.706
The memory of high-school-girls
engraved in my soul…

00:04:41.624 --> 00:04:43.542
I finished switching the videotapes!

00:04:43.542 --> 00:04:47.254
Then, let’s try this again. And, <i>click!</i>

00:04:52.927 --> 00:04:56.097
I forgot to rewind it.

00:04:56.097 --> 00:04:59.392
While I'm rewinding it,
I’ll explain things a little.

00:04:59.392 --> 00:05:02.561
I heard you whispering earlier that I was
Dokurobey’s descendant or something,

00:05:02.561 --> 00:05:03.979
but you’re mistaken.

00:05:03.979 --> 00:05:05.523
We are?

00:05:05.523 --> 00:05:10.403
I am Dokurobey…
The one and only Dokurobey.

00:05:10.403 --> 00:05:14.490
I am the world’s one and
only flower Dokurobey!

00:05:14.490 --> 00:05:17.368
What? Then, that means…

00:05:17.368 --> 00:05:21.205
That’s right. I am the same Dokurobey.

00:05:21.205 --> 00:05:22.665
That can’t be!

00:05:22.665 --> 00:05:25.918
Just how many years
do you think have passed?!

00:05:25.918 --> 00:05:28.254
No human can live such a long time!

00:05:28.254 --> 00:05:29.422
He’s right!

00:05:29.422 --> 00:05:32.049
I'm not a human.

00:05:32.049 --> 00:05:36.387
I'm an alien, an XYZian, from Planet Dokuro.

00:05:36.387 --> 00:05:37.680
An alien?

00:05:37.680 --> 00:05:38.806
No way…

00:05:38.806 --> 00:05:41.600
I see… So aliens do exist, huh?

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:42.935
Don’t be convinced!

00:05:42.935 --> 00:05:44.645
But he’s right there, so…

00:05:44.645 --> 00:05:45.855
So, they really exist…

00:05:45.855 --> 00:05:47.857
I said, don’t be convinced!

00:05:47.857 --> 00:05:51.068
It’s not surprising that he could
live so long if he’s an alien.

00:05:51.068 --> 00:05:52.611
Not surprising.

00:05:52.611 --> 00:05:55.281
These people accept just about anything.

00:05:55.281 --> 00:05:57.158
You accept things too easily!

00:05:57.158 --> 00:06:00.453
So, what have you, an alien,
been doing on Earth?

00:06:00.453 --> 00:06:03.372
I was just about to explain it to you.

00:06:03.372 --> 00:06:06.459
I was caught in the explosion that created Earth

00:06:06.459 --> 00:06:09.211
and my body got torn into pieces.

00:06:09.211 --> 00:06:11.547
In order to go back to space,
I needed Dokuro Stones.

00:06:11.547 --> 00:06:15.134
Oh, by the way, the pieces of
my body are called Dokuro Stones.

00:06:15.134 --> 00:06:18.762
Anyway, I was trying to have the thieves
named Doronjo, Boyacky, and Tonzra

00:06:18.762 --> 00:06:20.806
collect those Dokuro Stones.

00:06:22.933 --> 00:06:26.395
I’ll play the video now to show
you what happened after that.

00:06:51.504 --> 00:06:52.505
Hm?

00:06:52.505 --> 00:06:53.881
This song…

00:07:01.555 --> 00:07:05.309
I wanted to collect Dokuro Stones
and go back to space.

00:07:05.309 --> 00:07:08.979
That was all I wanted, but for
some reason… for some reason,

00:07:08.979 --> 00:07:11.482
Yatterman got in my way!

00:07:11.482 --> 00:07:16.195
Over and over again!
They continued to get in my way.

00:07:16.195 --> 00:07:21.784
Why did they have to get in my way?
I didn’t do anything wrong!

00:07:27.665 --> 00:07:30.501
Well, anyway, many things happened after that,

00:07:30.501 --> 00:07:34.964
and I was able to collect Dokuro Stones
and go back to space in the end.

00:07:34.964 --> 00:07:36.924
But then, I couldn’t sit still.

00:07:36.924 --> 00:07:41.053
I felt that I just had to take revenge
on Yatterman who got in my way!

00:07:41.053 --> 00:07:47.309
So, I came back to Earth, but then
I lost and went back to space again.

00:07:47.309 --> 00:07:49.144
Then I came back to Earth
again and lost again.

00:07:49.144 --> 00:07:51.063
I went back, came back,
lost again and went back again.

00:07:51.063 --> 00:07:54.650
No matter how many times I came back,
I always lost. It was really frustrating.

00:07:54.650 --> 00:07:57.027
So, I vowed to myself
that I’d win this time.

00:07:57.027 --> 00:08:00.739
I didn’t need that useless
bunch, so I exiled them.

00:08:00.739 --> 00:08:03.576
It was punishment time!

00:08:07.246 --> 00:08:08.539
Our ancestors…

00:08:08.539 --> 00:08:09.957
This song was passed down…

00:08:09.957 --> 00:08:11.875
…from generation to generation?

00:08:11.875 --> 00:08:16.422
So, I thoroughly prepared myself
and came back to Earth…

00:08:16.422 --> 00:08:20.009
to punish--no, to fight a war!

00:08:20.009 --> 00:08:21.844
A war?!

00:08:21.844 --> 00:08:27.308
It’s punishment time!

00:08:29.101 --> 00:08:31.186
I was thoroughly prepared,

00:08:31.186 --> 00:08:36.859
so I succeeded in defeating
Yatterman after a fierce battle.

00:08:44.158 --> 00:08:45.951
Punishment…!

00:08:45.951 --> 00:08:49.455
You started a war and made people
suffer for a reason like that?!

00:08:49.455 --> 00:08:52.791
Sacrifices are unavoidable in a war for justice.

00:08:52.791 --> 00:08:57.129
There’s no such thing as a war
for justice! Wars are always bad!

00:08:57.129 --> 00:09:01.634
Our ancestors worked for you,
Great Dokurobey, and yet you exiled them?!

00:09:01.634 --> 00:09:05.971
You damned fool!
You’re speaking like an immature kid!

00:09:05.971 --> 00:09:07.806
I am a kid!

00:09:11.310 --> 00:09:12.853
Miss Doronjo!

00:09:14.688 --> 00:09:16.690
You shouldn’t move.

00:09:16.690 --> 00:09:20.486
You’re tied up so you
can’t do anything anyway.

00:09:20.486 --> 00:09:23.656
Why are you guys obeying
Great Dokurobey’s orders?!

00:09:23.656 --> 00:09:25.199
Dokurobey?

00:09:25.199 --> 00:09:26.867
It’s ready, sir.

00:09:26.867 --> 00:09:30.412
Now, for part two of my glory.

00:09:30.412 --> 00:09:35.250
Although I defeated Yatterman,
my irritation didn’t go away.

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:40.923
Not just Yatterman, but humans also
persecuted me and got in my way.

00:09:40.923 --> 00:09:48.597
I had to make them suffer more
and more. It was punishment time!

00:09:48.597 --> 00:09:51.517
What do you think I did
to make them suffer?

00:09:51.517 --> 00:09:55.020
I assumed the name Yatterman.

00:09:56.355 --> 00:10:00.109
I abandoned the land humans could
no longer live in due to the war

00:10:00.109 --> 00:10:03.237
and founded Yatter Kingdom in Hulkkaido.

00:10:03.237 --> 00:10:07.783
I made humans thoroughly deify Yatterman,

00:10:07.783 --> 00:10:10.744
and I thoroughly forced them to work for me.

00:10:10.744 --> 00:10:14.832
They’re made to work for their entire lives,
thinking that it’s for Yatterman!

00:10:14.832 --> 00:10:17.292
Without knowing that they’re
actually working for me

00:10:17.292 --> 00:10:21.046
and that they’re working for Doronbow,
whom they’ve been taught to despise!

00:10:21.046 --> 00:10:24.675
This is quite amusing
and exhilarating! And…

00:10:24.675 --> 00:10:26.009
What’s that?!

00:10:26.009 --> 00:10:27.636
It’s glowing?

00:10:27.636 --> 00:10:31.223
…the humans’ labor becomes my energy.

00:10:31.223 --> 00:10:36.311
Although I'm an alien, I'm not immortal,
so I need energy to live.

00:10:36.311 --> 00:10:41.525
I’ll make every last human
continue to work for me,

00:10:41.525 --> 00:10:43.902
until in the end, all humans are gone!

00:10:43.902 --> 00:10:48.323
Only then will my revenge be complete.

00:10:50.909 --> 00:10:53.203
You damned fool!

00:10:54.329 --> 00:10:55.914
Sorry about that, sir.

00:10:55.914 --> 00:11:00.210
That’s the end of the story.
ln other words, there’s no Yatterman.

00:11:00.210 --> 00:11:03.255
In a matter of speaking, I'm the Yatterman.

00:11:03.255 --> 00:11:06.633
So, hello again! I'm Yatterman.

00:11:06.633 --> 00:11:08.719
No, you’re Dokurobey!

00:11:08.719 --> 00:11:12.014
You guys, too! Why are
you obeying Dokurobey?!

00:11:12.014 --> 00:11:13.432
Dokurobey?

00:11:13.432 --> 00:11:16.685
Don’t talk nonsense.
That’s Lord Yatterman.

00:11:16.685 --> 00:11:19.021
You heard him calling himself Dokurobey

00:11:19.021 --> 00:11:21.648
and telling us everything, right?!

00:11:21.648 --> 00:11:24.443
No matter how you look
at him, he’s Dokurobey!

00:11:24.443 --> 00:11:26.779
He said he defeated Yatterman!

00:11:26.779 --> 00:11:28.530
What were you listening to?!

00:11:28.530 --> 00:11:30.783
These guys make no sense.

00:11:30.783 --> 00:11:34.620
Indeed. To think that they call
Lord Yatterman Dokurobey, of all things!

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:36.371
That’s outrageous!

00:11:36.371 --> 00:11:38.040
You’re wasting your time.

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:43.420
I made it so that they’d never
doubt that I'm Yatterman.

00:11:43.420 --> 00:11:46.006
Now, salute!

00:11:46.006 --> 00:11:48.675
Yatterman!

00:11:48.675 --> 00:11:50.469
See?

00:11:50.469 --> 00:11:54.681
Now, why don’t you enjoy
the life here with me?

00:11:54.681 --> 00:11:59.478
For the sake of old times, I can let you
join the Twelve Yatter Guardian Gods.

00:11:59.478 --> 00:12:02.981
Let’s see, one, two…
The Seventeen Yatter Guardian Gods?

00:12:02.981 --> 00:12:07.152
Oh, wait, I lost one, so it’ll be
the Sixteen Yatter Guardian Gods!

00:12:07.152 --> 00:12:10.072
I’ll never be par--

00:12:10.072 --> 00:12:15.369
Oh, that’s right.
I'm busy rooting for Hanshin.

00:12:15.369 --> 00:12:18.831
Throw them in jail.

00:12:18.831 --> 00:12:20.666
Yatterman!

00:12:20.666 --> 00:12:26.505
Enjoy the view of humans suffering
to your heart’s content from jail.

00:12:52.097 --> 00:12:54.224
I was able to get
Honorable Oda off of the chains,

00:12:54.224 --> 00:12:59.062
but they seem to be made of some
special metal. They wouldn’t budge.

00:12:59.062 --> 00:13:03.108
If you can’t remove them, no one can do it.

00:13:03.108 --> 00:13:04.192
At any rate,

00:13:04.192 --> 00:13:08.780
to think that high-school-girls means
female students in high school…

00:13:08.780 --> 00:13:12.325
I'm happy you could figure
it out. Compared to that,

00:13:12.325 --> 00:13:14.786
I’ve been seeing
Honorable Oda all this time as…

00:13:16.830 --> 00:13:19.291
How is it going over there?

00:13:19.291 --> 00:13:21.042
I'm trying but…

00:13:30.051 --> 00:13:32.721
It’s flying! You’re amazing, Gatchan!

00:13:32.721 --> 00:13:34.055
But…

00:13:35.891 --> 00:13:38.768
I don’t know how to unlock it.

00:13:38.768 --> 00:13:40.061
Yeah, I figured as much.

00:13:40.061 --> 00:13:41.938
We have to get out of here.

00:13:41.938 --> 00:13:45.775
I’ve always thought that it was
Yatterman who made everyone,

00:13:45.775 --> 00:13:48.069
including us and our ancestors, suffer.

00:13:48.069 --> 00:13:50.864
That’s why I’ve come this far. But…

00:13:50.864 --> 00:13:52.115
Doronjo…

00:13:52.115 --> 00:13:55.410
Geez, what do you do without me, oink?

00:13:55.410 --> 00:13:57.203
Let me use that thing, oink.

00:13:57.203 --> 00:13:58.914
Honorable Oda?

00:14:07.130 --> 00:14:09.507
Faster, oink!

00:14:13.094 --> 00:14:16.264
"Skylark" is written as "sky" and "lark",

00:14:16.264 --> 00:14:19.434
meaning skylarks can fly very
high in the sky on sunny days.

00:14:19.434 --> 00:14:21.645
You’ll be able to fly high in the sky, as well.

00:14:21.645 --> 00:14:24.272
Yep, Daddy. I will fly high.

00:14:45.168 --> 00:14:47.963
We converted them into cyborgs
and erased their memories.

00:14:47.963 --> 00:14:50.548
By the time the wake up, they’ll be your…

00:14:50.548 --> 00:14:52.801
Good job!

00:14:54.886 --> 00:14:56.680
Your name is Goro.

00:14:56.680 --> 00:15:01.434
From today on, put everything
you’ve got into working for me!

00:15:01.434 --> 00:15:03.103
Lord Yatterman,

00:15:03.103 --> 00:15:06.815
thank you very much for saving my life.

00:15:06.815 --> 00:15:10.860
Yatter! Yatter! Yatterman!

00:15:17.325 --> 00:15:18.410
Hold it!

00:15:18.410 --> 00:15:20.620
What’s a pig doing flying around?!

00:15:24.457 --> 00:15:26.835
Thanks for waiting, oink.

00:15:28.795 --> 00:15:31.673
Good job! Attaboy! You’re genius!

00:15:31.673 --> 00:15:34.217
A wise pig hides his nose, oink.

00:15:34.217 --> 00:15:36.511
You’re not a talking pig for nothing, huh?

00:15:36.511 --> 00:15:39.139
--That’s our Honorable Oda for you!
--Don’t you come near me!

00:15:39.139 --> 00:15:41.599
Honorable Oda…

00:15:41.599 --> 00:15:42.976
Let’s go, guys!

00:15:42.976 --> 00:15:43.685
Yes…

00:15:43.685 --> 00:15:44.686
…maam!

00:15:44.686 --> 00:15:46.354
Ally, hurry!

00:15:56.197 --> 00:15:57.574
Ally…

00:16:00.744 --> 00:16:04.873
Dog, help me with something.

00:16:08.710 --> 00:16:12.213
Yatter! Yatter! Yatter! Yatter!

00:16:12.213 --> 00:16:13.313
--Don't  let them get away!

00:16:12.213 --> 00:16:15.050
--Yatter Yatter…!

00:16:13.313 --> 00:16:15.050
--Capture them!

00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:18.219
Yatter! Yatter! Yatter! Yatter!

00:16:18.219 --> 00:16:19.512
They’re coming from the front, too!

00:16:19.512 --> 00:16:21.181
They’re attacking us from both sides!

00:16:21.181 --> 00:16:22.474
Yatter!

00:16:23.600 --> 00:16:25.685
Stop the useless resistance!

00:16:25.685 --> 00:16:27.479
Don’t think that you can get away!

00:16:27.479 --> 00:16:28.480
Capture them!

00:16:28.480 --> 00:16:30.732
Yatter!

00:16:37.197 --> 00:16:39.074
Y-You are…!

00:16:39.074 --> 00:16:39.908
No way!

00:16:39.908 --> 00:16:41.576
It can’t be…!

00:16:43.244 --> 00:16:46.081
General Goro?!

00:16:46.081 --> 00:16:47.540
Is he rebelling?

00:16:47.540 --> 00:16:51.336
Leave them to me!

00:16:51.336 --> 00:16:53.213
Miss Doronjo! This is a trap!

00:16:53.213 --> 00:16:55.006
No doubt about it!

00:16:55.006 --> 00:17:00.345
Ha! Even if it was a trap,
do you have any other choice?

00:17:01.346 --> 00:17:02.806
L-Let’s go!

00:17:02.806 --> 00:17:05.225
Yes, ma’am!

00:17:05.225 --> 00:17:08.394
There should be a Yatterstork on the rooftop!

00:17:08.394 --> 00:17:10.855
Use it to get out of here!

00:17:10.855 --> 00:17:12.899
He’s our enemy! Destroy him!

00:17:12.899 --> 00:17:14.359
Yatter!

00:17:46.099 --> 00:17:47.892
There, there.

00:17:50.895 --> 00:17:53.022
She’s full of energy!

00:17:54.858 --> 00:17:57.652
Seems like spring is here.

00:17:57.652 --> 00:18:01.197
Skylarks are like the angels
of spring, you know.

00:18:01.197 --> 00:18:02.907
Okay, I’ve decided!

00:18:02.907 --> 00:18:07.162
Your name is Alouette. It means skylark.

00:18:07.162 --> 00:18:10.665
How does that sound?
Do you like it, Alouette?

00:18:10.665 --> 00:18:13.501
No matter what happens,

00:18:13.501 --> 00:18:17.547
I’ll protect you with my life.

00:18:40.361 --> 00:18:42.655
Take care of Ally.

00:18:44.991 --> 00:18:46.284
Gatchan?

00:18:46.284 --> 00:18:49.120
Sorry, Ally. I’ll be right back!

00:19:03.968 --> 00:19:05.970
G-General Go--

00:19:07.472 --> 00:19:10.892
Didn’t I tell you to leave them to me?

00:19:12.227 --> 00:19:13.978
Beat it!

00:19:26.199 --> 00:19:29.077
Alouette!

00:19:29.077 --> 00:19:35.416
You’re my… angel!

00:19:56.938 --> 00:19:59.190
Done!

00:20:01.734 --> 00:20:03.861
You were able to take off the chains!

00:20:03.861 --> 00:20:07.991
It just came right off of me and dropped.
It was easy once I figured it out.

00:20:07.991 --> 00:20:10.451
You should’ve tried it from the start, oink!

00:20:10.451 --> 00:20:13.579
Where are Doronjo and Mr. Boyacky?

00:20:13.579 --> 00:20:15.164
We’re right over here!

00:20:15.164 --> 00:20:18.459
Where have you been, Gatchan?

00:20:18.459 --> 00:20:20.461
Ally…

00:20:20.461 --> 00:20:21.921
How does it look?

00:20:21.921 --> 00:20:24.757
I think we can fly it.

00:20:24.757 --> 00:20:28.469
--Please hurry up and get in!
--Yatter! Yatter! Yatter! Yatter!

00:20:32.515 --> 00:20:33.391
Hurry!

00:20:33.391 --> 00:20:36.602
Yes, ma’am! And <i>click.</i>

00:20:36.602 --> 00:20:38.438
Take off!

00:20:52.702 --> 00:20:54.245
It’s flying!

00:20:58.666 --> 00:20:59.834
Look!

00:21:12.472 --> 00:21:14.432
Dokurobey!

00:21:14.432 --> 00:21:16.517
I’ll never forgive him!

00:21:16.517 --> 00:21:17.935
Gatchan!

00:21:17.935 --> 00:21:19.687
I’ll never forgive Dokurobey!

00:21:19.687 --> 00:21:21.522
Yea , let’s bring him down!

00:21:21.522 --> 00:21:24.108
There’s no way we can
escape from him anyway.

00:21:24.108 --> 00:21:26.152
Let’s bring him down

00:21:26.152 --> 00:21:29.364
in order to bring a new
dawn to this dark world!

00:21:37.038 --> 00:21:39.999
It’s punishment time!

00:22:10.979 --> 00:22:18.069
Should I raise my RPM and dream?

00:22:20.279 --> 00:22:25.699
Don't put it off for tomorrow, do it now

00:22:25.699 --> 00:22:27.999
My strong heart wants to get started

00:22:27.999 --> 00:22:30.079
I want to see change, so let's go

00:22:29.959 --> 00:22:35.629
I'm running too fast to smell the roses

00:22:35.419 --> 00:22:37.669
My strong heart's at max speed

00:22:37.669 --> 00:22:40.259
I made a wish because I wanted a change

00:22:40.259 --> 00:22:44.219
I search, I tire, I fall, and I get back up

00:22:44.219 --> 00:22:50.849
I'll enjoy this every time

00:22:51.559 --> 00:22:53.519
Continue your passion

00:22:53.519 --> 00:22:55.979
Continue your passion

00:22:55.979 --> 00:22:57.269
I'll support you

00:22:57.269 --> 00:22:58.229
I'm on your side

00:22:58.229 --> 00:22:59.489
Jump, jump, pushing the limits is my life story

00:22:59.489 --> 00:23:01.279
Jump, jump, pushing the limits is my life story

00:23:01.279 --> 00:23:05.739
My drive ain't no work of fiction

00:23:05.739 --> 00:23:06.949
I want to see you

00:23:06.949 --> 00:23:07.989
Today, if I can

00:23:07.989 --> 00:23:09.749
After all, my fingers just won't stop

00:23:09.749 --> 00:23:11.119
After all, my fingers just won't stop

00:23:11.119 --> 00:23:15.209
Don't you know?

00:23:12.959 --> 00:23:16.539
Day and night, I'm missing you

00:23:16.169 --> 00:23:17.879
The world might get you down,

00:23:17.709 --> 00:23:17.879
Nothing in the world is going your way

00:23:17.879 --> 00:23:19.799
The world might get you down,

00:23:17.879 --> 00:23:20.259
Nothing in the world is going your way

00:23:20.259 --> 00:23:23.009
But continue your passions

00:23:23.009 --> 00:23:26.179
But continue your passions

00:23:29.889 --> 00:23:37.979
Keep praying and dreaming
